{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557100/extras/About_Game.gif?t=1743696147\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemies spawn every round and march toward your Crystal Tower.<br>Defend it against waves of increasingly stronger foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557100/extras/About_Game1.gif?t=1743696147\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each round, you\u2019ll receive a gear draw ticket.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use it to obtain random gear materials, and upgrade your equipment to higher tiers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557100/extras/About_Game2.gif?t=1743696147\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Between enemy waves, there are moments of peace.<br>Take that time to enter the mine and collect valuable resources.<br>Mining provides various materials that help your character grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557100/extras/About_Game3.gif?t=1743696147\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every 10 rounds, a powerful boss will appear.<br>These bosses are extremely tough.<br>If you're struggling to defeat one, check if you're lacking boss-specific equipment or abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557100/extras/About_Game4.gif?t=1743696147\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From the Unique tier and up, each piece of gear has its own skill.<br>Use these unique skills strategically to build the ultimate gear combinations.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3557100?t=1743696147","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3557100?t=1743696147","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557100/b3062393f52dc25af59e8b0d19e40c010a632594/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743696147","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557100/b3062393f52dc25af59e8b0d19e40c010a632594/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743696147","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3634390,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557100/extras/About_Game.gif?t=1743696147\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemies spawn every round and march toward your Crystal Tower.<br>Defend it against waves of increasingly stronger foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557100/extras/About_Game1.gif?t=1743696147\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each round, you\u2019ll receive a gear draw ticket.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use it to obtain random gear materials, and upgrade your equipment to higher tiers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557100/extras/About_Game2.gif?t=1743696147\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Between enemy waves, there are moments of peace.<br>Take that time to enter the mine and collect valuable resources.<br>Mining provides various materials that help your character grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557100/extras/About_Game3.gif?t=1743696147\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every 10 rounds, a powerful boss will appear.<br>These bosses are extremely tough.<br>If you're struggling to defeat one, check if you're lacking boss-specific equipment or abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557100/extras/About_Game4.gif?t=1743696147\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From the Unique tier and up, each piece of gear has its own skill.<br>Use these unique skills strategically to build the ultimate gear combinations.</p>","developers":["zeroinmars"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557100/7f9543a86cf89d96fbe6b0d432a17daff399af4e/header.jpg?t=1743696147","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13 High Sierra<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel Iris Graphics 4000/ AMD Radeon R9 M290 / Apple Silicon GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Built-in audio</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11 Big Sur<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple Silicon M1 / AMD Radeon R9<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Built-in audio</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257117436,"mp4":{